{
 "name": "M21-1, Part XII, Subpart ii, Chapter 2, Section A - Special Allowance Under 38 U.S.C. 1312(a)",
 "content": "<p style=\"text-align: right\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 11px\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><a class=\"eGainArticleLink\" articleid=\"554400000175222\" articlename=\"M21-1, Part XII, Subpart ii, Chapter 1 - Death Compensation\" href=\"https://www.knowva.ebenefits.va.gov/system/ws/v11/ss/article/554400000175222?portalId=554400000001018&usertype=customer&\">&lt;-- Previous Section</a>&nbsp;<a class=\"eGainArticleLink\" articleid=\"554400000175224\" articlename=\"M21-1, Part XII, Subpart ii, Chapter 2, Section B - Eligibility Determinations and Claims for the Special Allowance Under 38 U.S.C. 1312(a)\" href=\"https://www.knowva.ebenefits.va.gov/system/ws/v11/ss/article/554400000175224?portalId=554400000001018&usertype=customer&\">Next Section --&gt;</a></span></span></p><h2><a id=\"Top\" name=\"Top\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">Overview</span></span></strong></a></h2><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><div style=\"margin-left: 1.2in\"><hr /></div><div></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">In This Section</span></span></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\">\t\t\t<p></p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px\">\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">This section contains the following topics:</span></span></div>\t\t\t<div></div>\t\t\t<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" summary=\"Column 1 has the topic number and column 2 has the topic title.\">\t\t\t\t<thead>\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\t\t\t\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 86px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><strong>Topic</strong></span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t</th>\t\t\t\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 430px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><strong>Topic Name</strong></span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t</th>\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\t\t\t\t</thead>\t\t\t\t<tbody>\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 86px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">1</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 430px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><a href=\"#1\">Description of the Special Allowance Under 38 U.S.C. 1312(a)</a></span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 86px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">2</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 430px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><a href=\"#2\">Jurisdiction for Payment of the Special Allowance Under 38 U.S.C. 1312(a)</a></span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 86px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">3</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 430px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><a href=\"#3\">Answering Inquiries From Claimants</a></span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\t\t\t\t</tbody>\t\t\t</table>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 1.2in\"><hr /><p>&nbsp;<br />&nbsp;</p></div><h2><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">1<a id=\"1\" name=\"1\">.</a><span style=\"font-size: 16px\"><strong>&nbsp; Description of the Special Allowance Under 38 U.S.C. 1312(a)</strong></span></span></span></h2><div style=\"margin-left: 1.2in\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></span><br />&nbsp;</p><hr /></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">Introduction</span></span></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\">\t\t\t<p></p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px\">\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">This topic describes the special allowance under 38 U.S.C. 1312(a), including </span></span></div>\t\t\t<ul>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><a href=\"#1a\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">description of the special allowance</span></span></a></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><a href=\"#1b\">who can be paid the special allowance</a>, and </span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><a href=\"#1c\">who cannot be paid the special allowance</a>.</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t</ul>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 1.2in\"><hr /></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">Change Date</span></span></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\"></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px\">\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">November 16, 2004</span></span></div>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 1.2in\"><hr /></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">XII.ii.2.A.1.a<a id=\"1a\" name=\"1a\">.</a>&nbsp; Description of the Special Allowance</span></span></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\">\t\t\t<p></p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px\">\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">The special allowance under <a href=\"http://www.law.cornell.edu/uscode/38/1312.html\" target=\"_blank\">38 U.S.C. 1312(a)</a> is a gratuitous benefit to the surviving dependents of a member of a uniformed service who was not a fully and currently insured individual under Title II of the Social Security Act who died on or after January 1, 1957 per <a href=\"https://www.ecfr.gov/cgi-bin/text-idx?SID=248499a92e578d26aaab8b06a3027ce4&amp;mc=true&amp;node=se38.1.3_1804&amp;rgn=div8\" target=\"_blank\">38 CFR 3.804</a>, either&nbsp;</span></span></div>\t\t\t<ul>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">while on active duty or active or inactive duty for training, or </span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">after separation as the result of a service-connected disability incurred after September 15, 1940.</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t</ul>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 1.2in\"><hr /></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">XII.ii.2.A.1.b<a id=\"1b\" name=\"1b\">.</a>&nbsp; Who Can Be Paid the Special Allowance</span></span></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\">\t\t\t<p></p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px\">\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">The special allowance is paid <strong><em>only</em></strong> to the persons as designated by and at the rates and for the periods certified by the Social Security Administration (SSA).</span></span></div>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 1.2in\"><hr /></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 128px; width: 115px\">\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">XII.ii.2.A.1.c<a id=\"1c\" name=\"1c\">.</a>&nbsp; Who Cannot Be Paid the Special Allowance</span></span></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 128px; width: 15px\"></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 128px; width: 516px\">\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">The special allowance cannot be paid based on&nbsp;</span></span></div>\t\t\t<ul>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">entitlement to compensation under</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t<ul>\t\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><a href=\"http://www.law.cornell.edu/uscode/38/1151.html\" target=\"_blank\">38 U.S.C. 1151</a>, and </span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><a href=\"http://www.law.cornell.edu/uscode/38/1160.html\" target=\"_blank\">38 U.S.C. 1160</a>, or</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t</ul>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">Philippine service under <a href=\"https://www.ecfr.gov/cgi-bin/text-idx?SID=248499a92e578d26aaab8b06a3027ce4&amp;mc=true&amp;node=se38.1.3_1804&amp;rgn=div8\" target=\"_blank\">38 CFR 3.804(b)(2)</a>.</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t</ul>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 1.2in\"><hr /></div><p>&nbsp;<br />&nbsp;</p><div></div><h2><span style=\"font-size: 16px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">2<a id=\"2\" name=\"2\">.</a>&nbsp; Jurisdiction for Payment of the Special Allowance Under 38 U.S.C. 1312(a)</span></strong></span></h2><p>&nbsp;<br />&nbsp;</p><div style=\"margin-left: 1.2in\"><hr /></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">Introduction</span></span></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\">\t\t\t<p></p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px\">\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">This topic contains information on the&nbsp;jurisdiction for payment of the special allowance under 38 U.S.C. 1312(a), including</span></span></div>\t\t\t<ul>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><a href=\"#2a\">jurisdiction of special allowance claims</a>, and </span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><a href=\"#2b\">transfer of folders to the Philadelphia Pension Management Center (PMC)</a>.</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t</ul>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 1.2in\"><hr /></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">Change Date</span></span></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\"></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px\">\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">August 14, 2014</span></span></div>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 1.2in\"><hr /></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 232px; width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">XII.ii.2.A.2.a<a id=\"2a\" name=\"2a\">.&nbsp;</a> Jurisdiction of Special Allowance Claims</span></span></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 232px; width: 15px\"></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 232px; width: 516px\">\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">The Philadelphia Pension Management Center (PMC) has the sole authority to make awards and payments of the special allowance under <a href=\"http://www.law.cornell.edu/uscode/text/38/1312\" target=\"_blank\">38 U.S.C 1312(a)</a>.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></div>\t\t\t<div></div>\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">Development of special allowance claims is the responsibility of the regional office (RO) with original jurisdiction.&nbsp;</span></span></div>\t\t\t<div></div>\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><strong><em>References</em></strong>:&nbsp; For more information on</span></span></div>\t\t\t<ul>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">development of entitlement for the special allowance, see <a class=\"eGainArticleLink\" articleid=\"554400000175225\" articlename=\"M21-1, Part XII, Subpart ii, Chapter 2, Section C - Development of Claims for the Special Allowance Under 38 U.S.C. 1312(a)\" href=\"https://www.knowva.ebenefits.va.gov/system/ws/v11/ss/article/554400000175225?portalId=554400000001018&usertype=customer&\">M21-1, Part XII, Subpart ii, 2.C</a>, and </span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">subsequent transfer of folders to the Philadelphia PMC, see <a href=\"#2b\">M21-1, Part XII, Subpart ii, 2.A.2.b</a>.</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t</ul>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 1.2in\"><hr /></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 174px; width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">XII.ii.2.A.2.b<a id=\"2b\" name=\"2b\">.&nbsp;</a> Transfer of Folders to the Philadelphia PMC</span></span></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 174px; width: 15px\"></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 174px; width: 516px\">\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">When the SSA furnishes <em>SSA Form 101</em>, <em>Determination of Award</em>, <em>SSA Form 101C</em>, <em>Determination of Award</em>, or <em>SSA Form 101U3</em>, <em>Determination of Award</em> to the RO to authorize payment&nbsp;</span></span></div>\t\t\t<ul>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">take necessary adjudicative action on any other claim pending in the case, and </span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">once adjudicative action is completed, permanently transfer the deceased Veteran\u2019s claims folder to the Philadelphia PMC for payment of the special allowance under <a href=\"http://www.law.cornell.edu/uscode/text/38/1312\" target=\"_blank\">38 U.S.C 1312(a)</a>.</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t</ul>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 1.2in\"><hr /><p>&nbsp;<br />&nbsp;</p></div><h2><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">3<a id=\"3\" name=\"3\">.</a>&nbsp; Answering Inquiries From Claimants</span></span></strong></h2><p>&nbsp;<br />&nbsp;</p><div style=\"margin-left: 1.2in\"><hr /></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">Introduction</span></span></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\">\t\t\t<p></p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px\">\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">This topic contains information on answering inquiries from claimants, including information on&nbsp;</span></span></div>\t\t\t<ul>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><a href=\"#3a\">inquiries answered by the Department of Veterans Affairs (VA)</a>, and </span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><a href=\"#3b\">referring inquiries to the SSA</a>.</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t</ul>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 1.2in\"><hr /></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">Change Date</span></span></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\"></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px\">\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">November 16, 2004</span></span></div>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 1.2in\"><hr /></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">XII.ii.2.A.3.a<a id=\"3a\" name=\"3a\">.</a>&nbsp; Inquiries Answered by VA</span></span></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\">\t\t\t<p></p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px\">\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">After the approval of an award, the Department of Veterans Affairs (VA) answers inquiries relating to&nbsp;</span></span></div>\t\t\t<ul>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">when the initial payment will be made </span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">the nonreceipt of a check </span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">the change of address of the payee, and </span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">the change of fiduciary.&nbsp;</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t</ul>\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><strong><em>Note</em></strong>:&nbsp; Include the Social Security number on any correspondence sent to a payee.&nbsp; Send a copy of the letter to the servicing SSA Program Service Center (PSC).</span></span></div>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 1.2in\"><hr /></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">XII.ii.2.A.3.b<a id=\"3b\" name=\"3b\">.</a>&nbsp; Referring Inquiries to the SSA</span></span></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\">\t\t\t<p></p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px\">\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">Refer all inquiries pertaining to matters other than those listed in <a href=\"#3a\">M21-1, Part XII, Subpart ii, 2.A.3.a</a> to the servicing SSA PSC, using a locally-generated letter, and inform the claimant of the referral.&nbsp;</span></span></div>\t\t\t<div></div>\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><strong><em>Note</em></strong>:&nbsp; This includes inquiries concerning the amount of payment and termination of payments.</span></span></div>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 1.2in\"><hr /></div><p style=\"text-align: right\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 11px\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><a class=\"eGainArticleLink\" articleid=\"554400000175222\" articlename=\"M21-1, Part XII, Subpart ii, Chapter 1 - Death Compensation\" href=\"https://www.knowva.ebenefits.va.gov/system/ws/v11/ss/article/554400000175222?portalId=554400000001018&usertype=customer&\">&lt;-- Previous Section</a>&nbsp;<a class=\"eGainArticleLink\" articleid=\"554400000175224\" articlename=\"M21-1, Part XII, Subpart ii, Chapter 2, Section B - Eligibility Determinations and Claims for the Special Allowance Under 38 U.S.C. 1312(a)\" href=\"https://www.knowva.ebenefits.va.gov/system/ws/v11/ss/article/554400000175224?portalId=554400000001018&usertype=customer&\">Next Section --&gt;</a></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><a href=\"#top\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px\">To Top</span></a></span></p>",
